# Large Model Binaries Assessment (GitHub 50MB warning / 100MB limit):
# Pretrained & trained checkpoints are organized locally in:
#   - models/pretrained/yolo11m.pt (40.7 MB)
#   - models/trained/intelliproctor_phase1_iter1/best.pt (40.6 MB)
#   - models/trained/intelliproctor_phase1_iter1/last.pt (40.6 MB)
# For remote pushing, use Git LFS:
#   git lfs install
#   git lfs track "*.pt"
